<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi authorities condemned the deadly attack on a Greek Orthodox church in Jordan and arrested suspects, while Iraqi leaders blamed external agents for the incident. The Iraqi prime minister announced that armed factions and weapons are being placed under state control and warned that such groups could be drawn into a potential US-Iran conflict. Iraqi forces, cooperating with the UAE, seized 200,000 Captagon pills in a joint operation. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOVGlQcnB5Ql9fWXZEekN3cWpRLWtmVlhuX3BBaExfNXkyQTlaLTFqcV9zX0pjVms5bGdUR2JKNHgwLUdJV04wNXV3VGlaakZyemtvYUZTZmtJRUZ3aWFRMnI5dnI0T0hPbUZJMVY5Z1dMNXZoSkpOZWpLbmtndXFVTzJhQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The420.in&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5oLWFmaDkwcmRjc2lNbmswX18wdTJVZFhZMWU5NGx0RV9aOWs3TDJWRFZ5N18wVjRYMThKTDRUMWZpX2ZQSnNwbDcwSVpjMFl3WEl3YTZTMTc?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQSkwzdmVjM1VleTdFdUZub3RRWnFNc1pxbmhQeHpFd2kyT0lrX3hULURFQjdwOEY1SnB5X2pSUFFhQk5mX01UTTREUlRkT3FabURPV3g2NmRCdXgtNTFVWnRzZ3BNcGZiQ1BJSGRoVFkwM2I5aGZobHZULVlrVjdLdDRzMHVaNGx4eG5QbmpWS3NHOVJvd0FNazl2bjlzMVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Forum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNbC1iaW5QNFdHaEJZT3NuTTFObjR2RVVoNHJJR2IxRjl4U3lvREs1RWoxN085OUFSc04taVlPVWRDdjZEQkl3ci1BTG9jTWFmOVFBXzh3dVFmUzR5UFFYbzZyVjFMd2pOYmpmaG9BQUwyd2RQbFJwd2VvTHZKTEdhaTk0bldWRE5HVS1W